<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">Titosas</para>
  <para style="mt1">Titosas</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wossa keeththa kalethizaytnae wordo astamarista</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossas doretidayta amanoninne tumu ayanan kallethiza tumma eratethan dichanamala Xoossa aylene Yesus Kirstosape kitetida Phawulosape. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iza amanoyinne eratethay kaasepe ooykidi wordotonta Goday daro wodeppe kasse ba imida medhina deyo ufaysa malakko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izi kasse gidamala nuna ashida Xoossa azazon hadara imetida sabakon ba qaala qonccisides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nus kothe gidida tumu amanon ta na Titosas “Xoossa aawape nuna ashida Yesus Kiristossape kiiyatethane sarotethi nes giido.</para>
  <para style="s">Qarxasen Titosa Ootho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ta nena qarxxesen agiday burope giigana bessiza daro mishi diza gish ne gigsanamalane ta nena azazidamala katamay dizason wossa keeththa ciimata ne doranasa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Cmatethan doristanayti ista bolla boroy bayndayta, isi machi azinata, nayti amanizaytane waysontayta woykko azazetiza nayta awata gideto. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wossa keeththa ciimay Xoossas oothana hadara ekidade gididamala iza bolla wothay bayndade gidanas beses. Hesiikka ceqetizade, gutha miishan ylotizadene mathotizade, ushanchanne izas besonta ogera go7a gididaz godi eki bizade gidanas besena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hesafe bollara izi imath makiizade loo7o ootho dosizade berka bena hariizade sure as xiilone bes nagetizade gidanas beses. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hara asata loo7o timrten miithethzadenne he loo7o timirteza ixizayta hanqanas ba tamaridamala qalan minizade gidanas beses. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Waysizaytine dunan xalala balethzayti daroti detes; harapekka heyti qaxaretida Ayhuda asatape ammanida asata bagatakko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heytanta co77u histethi beses. Gaasoyka isti besonta oogera bes go7a demanas besonta timrte tamarson keeththa asa wursi moron detes. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ista Nabistappe isadey ista gish hasa7ishe “Qarxesa asay wuriso wode wordanchatane ita do7ota ganjjemane azalata” giides. f/ nabeza sunthi Epimenidese. <verse number="13" style="v"/>He markatethay tumu hessa gish ne ista loo7etha hanqista. Hesikka ista tumma amanoy danamalasa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ayhuddata haysu7e woykko tumu yooppe hakida asata azazo isti siyopetto. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Geshatas mishi wurikka geshsha shin tuatasinne amnontaytas gidikko wurikka tunakko. Harapekka ista qohaaththaaykka wurikka tunides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Isti bena nu Xoosu eros getes shin ba hanotethan dikokka gidiko kadetes. Isti shunizayta, azazetontaytanne loo7o oothos besontaytakko.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tummu timirte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ne gidikko asa tumu gididaz tamarsa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Cimma asay wozinama bonchetidayta bena berkka harizayta amanoninne siiqon danda7anka loo7o gidanamala ista zora. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hesathoka cima maccashati bee diza dussan bonchora dizaytanne loo7o hanoteth asa tamarisizayta gideto attiin asa sunthu isizayta woykko woyne ush ussa suken waxetidayta gidonta mala ista tamarsa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hesatho oothikko natetha maccashati ba azinatane ba nayta dosanamala tamarsanas dandadha7etes. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossa qalay oona achanka cayetontamala isti berikka bena harizaytane geshata keeththa gidon ista oothoy ooykidaytanne asas kiiyata ba azinatas azazetizayta giidanamala ciima maccashati ista tamariseto. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hesathokka yalaga atumasay berka bena haranamala ne ista zaro. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ay hanonkka ne asas loo7o lemuso gida. Ne asa tamarsiza timirteza nekka wozinape tamarisizadene nagizade gida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu gish ita has7iza asay hasa7anas iita demonta agidi yelatanamala ne has7iiza hasa7a garsan borso yoy doppo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ayleti azanka ba Godatas haristanamalanne ufaysanamala qasekka awute zarontamala tamarisa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hanizazan wurison nuna ashida Xoossa timirtey dosistanamala isti loo7o markateth besanamala ba godata mishe kaysotopeto. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asas izape maroy betiza Xoossa kiiyatethi asa wursos qonccides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>He kiiyatethaykka nuni nagaran dusune ha alame amotetha kadidi hayssa ha wodezan nurkka nuna haridine xiilotethan tumu ayana dus danaysa nuna tamarises. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hesikka nus anjjetida ufays gidida woga Xoossane nuna ashida Yesus Korstosa bonchoy qooncanaysa naganasa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Izikka nuna itetethafe wozanasinne loo7o oothanas miiniza ba dere bees doranas bena nus aathi iimides. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gish ne tamarsanayti heytanta. Hessakka ne kumetha Godatethara zoranne hanqqa nena oonikka kadhoppo.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Loo7o Ootho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Assay dere aysizaytas haristanamalane loo7o gidida miish wursi oothanas giga gidanamala asa qofissa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qasekka oonikka asa bollla iita hasa7ontamalane loo7o asa gidanamala asa wursos kumetha wozinappe ba ashketeth besanamala wuisa qofissa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nukka kasse qofay bayndaytane azazetontayta ne balletizayta duma duma amoninne loo7o dusas ayletethan haretizaytakko. Asarane nurka nu gasanka oyetishe itatethaninne miqaynetethan doos. <verse number="4-5" style="v"/>Gido attiin nuna ashida Xoossa kiiyatethinne iza siqqoy qonccida wode nu oothida xiilotethan gidonta dishin iza marotetha daron atidos, izi nuna ashiday nam7antho yeleteth gidida mechaninne Xiillo Ayanan ooraxetethankko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hesaka Xiillo Ayanay nu bolla nu Gooda Xoossi nuna ashida Yesus Kirstosa bagara keezi darsi gusides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hesikka nu iza kiiyatethan xillidi medhiina deyo ufays ooyki layzayta gdanasa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hesikka amanetida qaala. Xoossa amanizayti loo7o oothos bena aathi imanamala hayssa ubbaa ne lo7etha yotanamala ta koyays. Hesikka loo7one ay asika koyizaza. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassekka coo hada palamapenne asay ba qomo qodizazape, lalefenne woga gish dendiza ooshafe ne hakka. Heytanti go7oy baynda pathonta yokko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Asa garsan shakoteth medhiza asa isi to nam7u to ne zorin ekonta ixxiko izadera nes ispetethi doppo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hesa mala asi baletida nagarancha asa izadey berkka ba bolla piirdidaysa ne era.</para>
  <para style="s">Wursethe zare.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Arxximone woykko Tikiqosa ta neekko kiitikko ne tako Niqqoliyonne yanas nes danda7etizaz ubbaa ootha. Tani halaytha ballgo hen athana gada qachadis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Woga eriza Zemasayne Aphillossay biishin istas koshzaz ubbaa kuntha mada. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu bagatas hachis hachis ista koshizaz isti demanamalane ista dethay goo7oy bayndaz gidontamala isti loo7o ootho oothi minanamala tamaranas koshes. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tanara dizayti intena saro getes. Amano gedon nuna siiqqizayta wursi saro giite. Xoossa kiyatethi intenara gido.</para>
</usx>
